    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> April 15, 2026</p>

    <p>This Privacy Policy describes how the <strong>"Antistress Games"</strong> project (hereinafter "we", "Data Controller") processes the data of users (hereinafter "User", "you") when using our casual web games (hereinafter "Games").</p>

    <p>We respect your privacy and comply with the requirements of the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), the Turkish Personal Data Protection Law (KVKK), and the applicable privacy laws of the Russian Federation (152-FZ).</p>

    <h2>1. Data We Collect</h2>
    <p>We do not require registration and do not directly collect your personal data (name, phone number, email). However, our Games use automated platform and analytics systems (e.g., Yandex SDK) which may collect:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> device type, model, screen resolution, operating system, browser type;</li>
        <li><strong>Network data:</strong> IP address (in anonymized form), approximate geographic location (country/city);</li>
        <li><strong>Game metrics:</strong> session duration, progress, levels reached, clicks, referral source;</li>
        <li><strong>Gaming Platform Data:</strong> When you log in via a platform account (Yandex Games, Odnoklassniki), we may access your public username and avatar solely to display them within the game (e.g., profile or leaderboards). We do not store this data on external servers.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. Purpose of Data Processing</h2>
    <p>Data is collected in an anonymized format for the following purposes:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Ensuring Game functionality (saving progress, leaderboards);</li>
        <li>Analyzing audience behavior and improving gameplay;</li>
        <li>Fixing technical bugs and optimizing performance;</li>
        <li>Displaying relevant advertisements via partner networks.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Legal Basis</h2>
    <p>Data processing is carried out based on:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Your consent, expressed by starting and continuing to use the Game;</li>
        <li>Our legitimate interests (improving product quality, ensuring security).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Third-Party Data Sharing</h2>
    <p>We do not sell your data. Anonymized data may be processed by the following partner services in accordance with their privacy policies:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Yandex Games Platform:</strong> For authorization, cloud saves, in-game purchases, and advertising. Governed by the <a href="https://yandex.com/legal/confidential/" target="_blank">Yandex Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>OK (Odnoklassniki) Platform:</strong> If the Game is played on this social network, the platform processes data for authorization and social features. Governed by the VK Privacy Policy.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics Services (e.g., Yandex.Metrica):</strong> To collect usage statistics.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Cookies and Local Storage</h2>
    <p>To save your game progress on your device, the Game uses browser Local Storage and cookies. You can clear this data at any time in your browser settings (this will reset your local game progress unless saved in the platform's cloud).</p>

    <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
    <p>We retain anonymized analytics data only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this Policy, typically no longer than 14 months from your last activity, after which it is automatically deleted by the analytics systems.</p>

    <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>Our Games are designed for a general audience. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children under 13 (or the applicable age requiring parental consent in your jurisdiction). If you are a parent or guardian and believe your child has provided us with data without your consent, please contact us.</p>

    <h2>8. User Rights</h2>
    <p>If you are located in the EU (GDPR), Turkey (Article 11 of KVKK), or the Russian Federation (152-FZ), you have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Request information about the data processed about you;</li>
        <li>Request deletion of your data (achieved by clearing your browser's cache/cookies and revoking permissions in your Yandex ID or OK account settings);</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent for data processing by ceasing use of the Game.</li>
    </ul>

